  "details": "Groups should have a permission section for the instance creator. In some specific cases, it is simply more convenient to stick with permissions that are close to friend/friends+ to ensure that there is always at least one person in the instance with moderation powers.\n\nIn addition, it could be useful to have a toggle that define if those permissions are \"taken away\" if an actual group member with moderation powers enters the instance.",
